# Run on the pull request's head before merging it.
# One command per line, in order; the first that fails stops the merge, unless the user passes it
# with the merge script's --override.
# This project's own commands go in scripts/check-commands-own.
task up
task check
# The routes of taskfiles/smoke-routes on the head's running stack (only / without that file), last since it needs the
# app up with the head's migrations and only tells something once the tests pass.
task smoke
